        "quote": "(a) For the purpose of providing the processing and payment of municipal tort or civil rights claims, referred to in this section as “claims,” arising on and after July 1, 1979, there is hereby established the special liability expense fund in the City treasury. The City special liability expense fund shall be liable for the processing and payment of the following:",
