          "end": 758,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:3.25.020:block:2",
          "start": 612
        },
        "quote": "(2) All court costs and other litigation-related expenses incurred in the defending of any such claim under subsection (a)(1) of this section; and",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:3.25.020:block:2#text",
